            <title>[KYLIN-5498] When the multi-level partition is enabled, changing model from incremental build to full build and select &apos;Save and Build&apos;, but there is no building job generated</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5498</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When the multi-level partition is enabled, changing model from incremental build to full build and select &apos;Save and Build&apos;, but there is no building job generated&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13531264">KYLIN-5498</key>
